title: '2. One mind writes the plan: the owner of the territory where its hardest decision lies. Others join it only as answerers, as builders of their own parts, or as independent proposers.'
pid: ed1da9a0-8972-4e28-9e0a-ca5f269588f8
body: |2-
  When each of those applies, and how, is
  [[id:436d5e47-89df-41ab-b763-5f989994883e][the rule for when a second specialist joins a plan]].
  Never a second author. Top does not write plans.
  Why, and its sources: [[id:7e77cd23-2f2d-4596-87f2-8448acaa834a][step 2, its reasons]].
